Note: This project aggregates astronomical data from public sources
(CDS VizieR — Harris 1996/2010, Vasiliev & Baumgardt 2021, Baumgardt & Hilker
2018, Bica et al. 2019; and the galstreams library by C. Mateu 2023).
Those data remain the property of their respective authors/institutions and are
redistributed here for research/educational use with attribution.
